label Episode4:
    call mod_set_vars
    stop music
    $ ep3endfreeroam = True
    $ ep3breakfastwithrin = True
    scene black with dissolve
    $ backhome = True
    $ renpy.pause()
    scene ep4 with dissolve
    $ renpy.pause(3,hard=True)
    show screen smartphone
    scene ep4_1 with fade
    play music "sfx/ep2_2.mp3"
    $ bgm = "Roa - Lights"
    u "..........."
    u "The weekend is over."
    u "There wasn't much to talk about."
    u "..........."
    u "...Well, actually there was something wrong with [yui] when she came back from visiting her family."
    u "She should've been happy, but she seemed so pissed off."
    u "I don't know what happened though. I didn't ask her about it."
    u "By the way, I still haven't got a new assignment from [victor]."
    u "I guess I'll just have to keep a low profile for now."
    scene ep4_2 with dissolve
    unknown "Good morning, [mc]."
    u "...Hm?"
    scene ep4_3 with dissolve
    mc "....[faye]?"
    faye "Yep. It's me."
    faye "Why do you seem so confused?"
    faye "It's not like we haven't met before."
    mc "Well, I didn't expect you to greet me."
    scene ep4_4 with dissolve
    mc "Oh, I'm sorry. I shouldn't be sitting down."
    faye "It's okay. I don't mind that."
    faye "Didn't [pete] tell you that our company doesn't mind little things like that?"
    mc "He told me that. But, I prefer to do it this way."
    faye "I see. Just do whatever you want then."
    mc "....By the way, is there something that you want from me?"
    scene ep4_5 with dissolve
    faye "Nothing. I was on the way to [pete]'s room when I saw you."
    faye "So, I decided to greet you."
    mc "............"
    faye "Don't you believe me?"
    mc "...Well, you know... Judging from what everybody calls you."
    mc "I thought you were going to walk past me like last time."
    scene ep4_6 with dissolve
    faye "Hm? What everybody calls me?"
    faye "The arrogant goddess?"
    mc "Hm? You know about that, too?"
    faye "Yes. I know that people in this company give nicknames for me and other girls."
    faye "I can't remember what we're called though. Six goddesses?"
    mc "Angels. It's six angels. But, it has become Seven Angels now because of the new girl in my department."
    faye "So... The arrogant angel, hm? I like that."
    mc "Actually, you don't seem to be arrogant, though."
    scene ep4_5 with dissolve
    faye "But I am. Don't you remember the first time we met?"
    faye "I completely ignored you."
    mc "Well... You're right. But, why did you decide to greet me this time then?"
    faye "I ignore people I don't find good enough reasons to talk with."
    faye "And you were nobody back then. So, I didn't see any point in talking to you."
    mc "That's kind of harsh...."
    faye "Yeah, I know that. That's why people call me arrogant."
    faye "However, I changed my mind after the meeting."
    faye "I want to build a relationship with you."
    mc "But why?"
    faye "You have the potential to become one of the best employees here."
    faye "So, who knows? You might be useful to me one day."
    scene ep4_6 with dissolve
    mc ".........."
    faye "I know. You might think that I'm a bad person."
    faye "But, here is my thought: I don't have much time to make a lot of friends."
    faye "So, I better make friends with someone who is worth it."
    mc "Well, I can't say that your logic is wrong."
    mc "Actually, I think I even understand you."
    faye "Hm...? I didn't expect you to say that."
    faye "But, thanks for understanding."
    scene ep4_7 with dissolve
    faye "Alright, I have to go now."
    faye "Good luck with your work today, [mc]."
    mc "Thanks."
    faye "See you around."
    mc "See you."
    $ talkwithfaye = 1
    $ faye_ch1_ep4 += 1
    $ faye_relationship += 1
    scene black with dissolve
    $ renpy.pause()
    scene ep4_8 with dissolve
    u "..........."
    u "Okay. I think I should go back to work, too."
    u "It's been a while since I came out here to take a break."
    scene ep4_9 with dissolve
    u "Let's go back to the department."
    scene black with dissolve
    $ renpy.pause()
    scene ep4_10 with dissolve
    joe "Alright, boys. It's lunch time!"
    joe "Let's go find something good to eat!"
    david "How about we go to a pizza place?"
    liam "That sounds great. Let's go then."
    liam "Are you coming with us, [mc]?"
    mc "No, thanks."
    mc "I'm going to the cafe."
    liam "Alright, see you later then."
    scene black with dissolve
    $ renpy.pause()
    scene ep4_11 with fade
    s "Welcome to the cafe~!"
    unknown "...Oh!!"
    unknown "Hi, [mc]!"
    u "....Hm?"
    scene ep4_12 with dissolve
    sally "Over here!"
    mc "...[sally]? [eira]?"
    sally "Wow! It's nice to see you here!"
    scene ep4_13 with dissolve
    eira "Hello, [mc]."
    mc "Hi, [eira]."
    sally "How was your morning, [mc]?"
    mc "Not bad. What about you guys?"
    eira "Me, too."
    sally "It was fantastic!"
    sally "I went to the new map in the game. It was really beautiful!"
    mc "Really? I wish I could see it."
    sally "Oh? Do you want to dive into the game then?"
    sally "I can manage that."
    mc "Are you sure?"
    sally "Yes, I am!"
    sally "However, let's talk about it later. You should go order your food first!"
    mc "Okay. I'll be right back then."
    scene black with dissolve
    $ renpy.pause()
    scene ep4_14 with dissolve
    sally "What have you got here?"
    mc "...Chocolate pudding, and hot chocolate."
    sally "Heh~? I never knew that you really loved chocolate."
    mc "By the way, how would I be able to dive into the game?"
    mc "I'm not in the game testing department like you."
    sally "That's not a problem at all!"
    sally "I will just tell everyone that I'm taking you there to see bugs with your own eyes."
    sally "Just like when I took [liam] there last time."
    mc "Oh, yeah. You're right."
    mc "Then, when can we do it?"
    sally "I'm going to be quite busy this afternoon."
    sally "What about tomorrow?"
    mc "Sure. No problem."
    scene ep4_15 with dissolve
    u "....Hm?"
    u "I was so excited that I completely forgot about [eira]"
    u "The atmosphere is getting a bit awkward."
    u "Let's find something to talk about with her."
    scene ep4_16 with dissolve
    mc "[eira]."
    eira "!!!!"
    eira "*Cough*...Yes?"
    scene ep4_17 with dissolve
    mc "....Are you okay? Need some water?"
    eira "I'm good. What did you want to ask me?"
    mc "Have you found the model you want yet?"
    scene ep4_18 with dissolve
    eira "........."
    eira "...No, I haven't."
    mc "Really? No one is good enough for the job?"
    eira "Yeah, I sent some profiles to [faye]."
    eira "She's still not convinced."
    eira "She wants someone that is going to make people go crazy after seeing the advertisement."
    scene ep4_19 with dissolve
    mc "I see...."
    sally "You should send your profile to her then!"
    eira "...What do you mean?"
    sally "You're really pretty."
    sally "I bet people are really going to go crazy about you!"
    scene ep4_20 with dissolve
    eira "N-No, I'm not... That pretty!"
    eira "Actually, you're even prettier than me!"
    eira "And I'm no where near famous. [faye] wants someone who is really famous."
    sally "*Giggles*...I know! I was just teasing you!"
    sally "*Giggles*...Your reaction was very cute! I like it!"
    if ep3_krystalmessage3 == True:
        scene ep4_21 with dissolve
        u "Someone who is famous, and is going to make people go crazy."
        u "She must be really popular then..."
        u "I wonder who can meet such requirements."
        u "..........."
        u "...Wait. Hasn't [krystal] got them all?"
        u "She's really famous...."
        u "..........."
        u ".....Well, she {b}was{/b} famous."
        u "But, I'm sure that people will go crazy if she becomes the model for the advertisement."
        menu:
            "Suggest [krystal] to [eira]\n[eira1][smec] & [sally1]":
                scene ep4_21_a1 with dissolve
                mc "Can I suggest someone?"
                mc "I'm sure that she has everything you and [faye] have been looking for."
                eira "...Hm? Who is she?"
                scene ep4_21_a2 with dissolve
                mc "Her name is [krystal]."
                eira "[krystal]?"
                mc "Yes. And here is her picture."
                mc "Look, and judge if she's suitable for the job."
                eira "Okay..."
                scene ep4_21_a3 with dissolve
                eira "Wow... She's really beautiful."
                eira "She can surely pass [faye]'s expectations. No doubt."
                eira "Is she a model?"
                mc "No, she has no job right now."
                eira "That's bad. She lacks reputation...."
                eira "But, she's really beautiful though...."
                scene ep4_21_a4 with dissolve
                sally "*Giggles*...You just said that twice."
                sally "She must be really beautiful then."
                sally "You make me want to see her picture, too!"
                eira "Wait..."
                scene ep4_21_a3 with dissolve
                eira "She seems familiar. I think I saw her somewhere before..."
                eira "...[krystal]... [krystal]...."
                eira "Her name sounds familiar, too."
                sally "Yeah, I agree with you. Where have I heard this name from?"
                scene ep4_21_a4 with dissolve
                mc "She was the leader of G-Flowers."
                eira "Oh! I remember her now."
                sally "That's good news then! She was really popular back then."
                sally "She has got everything you have been looking for."
                scene ep4_21_a5 with dissolve
                eira "But, there were bad rumors about her since that day, though."
                mc "If that's your concern...."
                mc "I can confirm that everything you've heard about her is completely wrong."
                eira "It doesn't matter though."
                eira "What matters is the fact that she has a bad public image."
                scene ep4_21_a6 with dissolve
                eira "Look. I agree with you that she is very perfect for this job."
                eira "Actually, I really want to contact her right now."
                eira "But, I don't know if it's worth a risk to make her our model."
                mc "Can you just at least mention her to [faye]?"
                eira ".........."
                eira "I don't know. I guess you better talk to her yourself."
                eira "Let's go see her together after lunch."
                mc "Okay, sure!"
                scene ep4_21_a7 with dissolve
                sally "Alright, let's finish our lunch fast then!"
                sally "We've only got 20 minutes left."
                eira "Yeah, you're right..."
                scene black with dissolve
                $ renpy.pause()
                $ nominatekrystal = 1
                scene ep4_21_a8 with fade
                sally "Okay, guys. I have to go back to my department now."
                sally "Good luck convincing [faye]."
                eira "Thanks..."
                $ sally_ch1_ep4 += 1
                $ sally_relationship += 1
                $ eira_ch1_ep4 += 1
                $ eira_relationship += 1
                jump ep4_afternoon
            "Stay quiet":
                scene ep4_21_d1 with dissolve
                u "Nah. That's none of my business."
                u "I think she can find a job by herself."
                u "I don't need to help her do that."
                scene black with dissolve
                s "*Half an hour later*........"
                jump ep4_afternoon
    else:
        scene black with dissolve
        s "*Half an hour later*.........."
        jump ep4_afternoon
label ep4_afternoon:
    if nominatekrystal != 1:
        scene ep4_21_a8 with dissolve
        sally "Okay, guys. I have to go back to my department now."
        sally "See you later!"
        eira "Goodbye, [sally]."
        scene ep4_21_a9 with dissolve
        eira "..........."
        eira "....I should go, too."
        eira "[mc]."
        mc "...Hm?"
        eira "Can you give me... Your phone number before I go?"
        mc "....Okay, sure."
        eira "Thank you."
        $ eira_contact = True
        scene black with dissolve
        s "*About four hours later*......"
        jump ep4_evening
    if nominatekrystal == 1:
        scene ep4_21_a9 with dissolve
        mc "...So, where are we going to meet [faye]?"
        eira "I don't know."
        eira "Let me... Call her first."
        mc "Sure."
        scene ep4_21_a10 with dissolve
        eira "Hello, [faye]?"
        eira "It's me, [eira]."
        eira "..........."
        eira "I want to talk with you about the advertisement shooting."
        eira "Where are you now?"
        eira "..........."
        eira "...Okay. I'll be there in five minutes."
        scene ep4_21_a11 with dissolve
        eira "Alright, Let's go see [faye]."
        mc "Wait a sec."
        eira "Hm? What's wrong?"
        mc "I just realize that I haven't got your phone number yet."
        eira "...Oh. You want my phone number?"
        mc "Yeah, we'll be able to contact each other a lot easier that way."
        eira "...Okay, sure."
        $ eira_contact = True
        scene black with dissolve
        stop music fadeout 3.0
        s "*A few minutes later*......."
        scene ep4_21_a12 with fade
        play music "sfx/ch1ep2.mp3" fadein 2.0
        $ bgm = "Bensound - Little Idea"
        eira "Hi, [faye]."
        faye "Hello....Hm?"
        faye "[mc]? Why are you here?"
        mc "I came with [eira]."
        faye "I see..."
        faye "Alright, come and have a seat first."
        scene ep4_21_a13 with dissolve
        eira "...Who were those guys?"
        faye "Oh, you mean those people who just left the room?"
        eira "Yeah, we walked past... Each other."
        faye "They're the photographer team"
        faye "We just talked about how we are going to shoot the advertisement."
        eira "Hm? Do we need to hire them?"
        faye "Of course we do."
        faye "Even though we are going to do the shooting session in the game, we still need people who have knowledge about photography."
        scene ep4_21_a14 with dissolve
        faye "By the way, didn't you tell me that you wanted to talk about the advertisement shooting?"
        faye "Can I assume that you've found someone who is good enough to be the model already?"
        eira "...I'm sorry to let you down, but I haven't found anyone yet."
        eira "However, [mc] suggested someone to me."
        eira "That's why he is here with us."
        scene ep4_21_a15 with dissolve
        faye "Hm? Who do you think we should hire?"
        faye "Do you know her personally, [mc]?"
        mc "Yes, I do."
        mc "I'm sure that she has got everything you've been looking for."
        faye "Really? Is she an actress or a model?"
        scene ep4_21_a16 with dissolve
        mc "No, she is neither an actress nor a model."
        mc "She use to be in a girl group."
        mc "Her name is [krystal]."
        faye "Hm? I think I heard that name somewhere before..."
        mc "Well, you better look at her picture, and judge for yourself."
        scene ep4_21_a17 with dissolve
        faye "...Yeah. I know her!"
        faye "She was the leader of G-Flowers, wasn't she?"
        mc "Yeah, that's right."
        faye "..........."
        faye "Well, you're right. She is really perfect for this job."
        eira "I agree with that."
        scene ep4_21_a18 with dissolve
        faye "However, we can't use her. She has a really bad public image."
        faye "It's very risky to make her our advertising model."
        mc "....Yeah, I know that."
        faye "Also, I don't think the board will agree with that, either."
        scene ep4_21_a19 with dissolve
        eira "I understand your point, but isn't this a good opportunity?"
        faye "Good opportunity?"
        eira "Yes. She's been out of sight for 2 years."
        eira "There must be people who've been waiting for her comeback on screen again."
        eira "We might get better results than we think."
        scene ep4_21_a20 with dissolve
        faye "Yeah, there must be people who've been waiting for her, but have you forgotten her last concert?"
        faye "She also had a lot of haters, too."
        faye "Once she comes back, those haters will surely come and bash her again."
        faye "Worst case scenario, this can backfire on the company."
        scene ep4_21_a21 with dissolve
        eira "But, [mc] told me that all rumors about her aren't true."
        faye "It doesn't matter."
        faye "What matters is the fact that she has bad public image."
        u "............"
        u "This is so weird."
        u "I feel like I'm watching myself talking to [eira] 20 minutes ago."
        scene ep4_21_a22 with dissolve
        u "............."
        u "Well, things aren't going good here."
        u "There is no way [faye] will agree if I keep staying quiet."
        u "I guess I have to back [eira] up."
        mc "So, what if she didn't have a bad public image?"
        scene ep4_21_a23 with dissolve
        faye "Then, I'd contact her, and ask her to become our model immediately."
        mc "So, you're basically saying that it's the only problem that prevents her from being our model, right?"
        faye "Yes, you got it."
        mc "Okay then, I'll find a way to fix this problem."
        scene ep4_21_a24 with dissolve
        faye "Are you sure that you can do it?"
        mc "Yes, I am."
        mc "How long can you wait until you find someone else?"
        faye "Well, we'll start shooting in the next three weeks according to the plan."
        faye "So, I'll give you exactly two weeks. No more than that."
        faye "I also have to leave time to find a replacement in case you can't manage to fix the problem."
        scene ep4_21_a25 with dissolve
        mc "Got it."
        faye "I wish you good luck then."
        eira "Thank you for giving us the opportunity, [faye]."
        faye "You don't have thank me. To be honest, I also want her to become our model, too."
        eira "I know that."
        faye "Alright, you guys should leave now."
        faye "I have an appointment here in five minutes."
        eira "Sure. Goodbye, [faye]."
        $ discuss = 1
        $ eira_ch1_ep4 += 1
        $ eira_relationship += 1
        $ faye_ch1_ep4 += 1
        $ faye_relationship += 1
        scene black with dissolve
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ep4_21_a26 with dissolve
        eira "........."
        eira "Erm...[mc]."
        mc "Hm?"
        eira "How are you going to get rid of [krystal]'s bad public image."
        eira "Do you have any plans?"
        mc "I don't know. I'll have to think about it first."
        eira ".....Is there something... That you want me to help with?"
        mc "...No, not yet."
        eira "...Okay. Just tell me if you need my help, okay?"
        mc "Sure. Thank you."
        scene black with dissolve
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ep4_21_a27 with dissolve
        eira "Alright, I have to... Go back to my department now."
        eira "See you later, [mc]."
        mc "Okay, sure."
        mc "Goodbye, [eira]."
        eira "....Goodbye."
        scene black with dissolve
        s "*About four hours later*......"
        $ eira_ch1_ep4 += 1
        $ eira_relationship += 1
        jump ep4_evening
label ep4_evening:
    scene ep4_22 with dissolve
    yui "What are you doing, [mc]?"
    yui "Hurry up. Let's go home."
    mc "Just give me a sec."
    scene black with dissolve
    s "You arrive home twenty minutes later......"
