        krystal "I don't know..."
        krystal "I guess I'll try my luck on finding a part-time job."
        krystal "I'm not sure if it will work this time, but I'll try my best."
        scene ep4_24_a6_a1 at eyesblink("Ch.1/Ep.4/Scenes/ep4_24_a6_a1.jpg", "Ch.1/Ep.4/Scenes/ep4_24_a6_a1_blink.jpg", 1) with dissolve
