        mc "But, what's the point in doing that if you can't go out, and meet new people?"
        krystal "............."
        scene ep4_24_a6_a9 with dissolve
        krystal "....Yeah, you're right."
        krystal "I should stay strong in order to move on with my life."
        krystal "And you said that they're all nice people."
        krystal "I believe you, so let's go meet them."
        mc "Okay. Let me go get changed first."
        mc "I'll come get you here in five minutes."
        krystal "Sure!"
        scene black with dissolve
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ep4_25 with dissolve
        u "Alright, let's go to my room."
        scene black with dissolve
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ep4_26 with dissolve
        s "Five minutes later, after changing your outfit."
        u "Okay. Let's go back to [krystal]."
        scene black with dissolve
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ep4_26_a1 with dissolve
        s "*Door knocks*........"
        mc "...[krystal]."
        krystal "..........."
        mc "Let's go."
